{%- comment -%}
  destination-quiz — 撮影地 30秒診断（シネマティック・フルスクリーン版 v3）
  ==================================================================
  【診断ロジックは変更していません】
  質問データ(QUESTIONS)・スコアリング・結果マッチング(matchDestinations)は
  従来のまま。変更したのは見た目とモーションのみ。

  結果候補は都市名を1件もハードコードしていない。ページ読み込み時に
  Liquidが shop.metaobjects.destination.values を全件JSONに書き出し、
  診断終了後はJS側でそのJSONをスコアでソートするだけ。新しい都市を
  Metaobjectに追加してthemesタグを設定するだけで診断結果は自動反映される。

  質問文・選択肢の文言はこのファイル内のQUESTIONS配列を直接編集する
  （選択肢とテーマタグの対応関係を壊さないよう、あえてブロック化して
  いない。変更したい場合は聞いてください）。

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  【v3について】
  ユーザーが用意した参考HTML(1画面ずつのフルブリード写真+マスク
  テキストreveal+スロットマシン演出の結果発表+マッチ度%表示+
  シェア機能、というシネマティックな診断UI一式)を元に、見た目と
  インタラクションを作り直した。参考HTMLのコードはコピーしておらず、
  同じ演出をこのサイトのデータ構造・診断ロジックに合わせて一から
  実装している。参考HTML側は7問の分岐診断+予算/日程による都市の
  絞り込みという別物のロジックを持っていたが、そちらは移植せず、
  既存のQUESTIONS配列(4問・単一選択・テーマタグ加点方式)のみを使う。

  参考実装との主な違い(データを持っていない項目は省略、または
  既存データから正直に算出できる形に置き換えている):
  - 予算/日程による分岐・disabled選択肢・upsell(予算アップ提案)は
    実装していない(このサイトの診断に予算・日程の質問が無いため)。
  - 複数選択(チップ)形式は実装していない(QUESTIONSが全問単一選択のため)。
  - 「マッチ度%」「マッチした条件/対応できない条件」は、選んだ
    テーマタグと診断結果の都市が実際に持つテーマタグを比較して算出
    (既存のscores/themesデータをそのまま可視化しているだけで、
    新しい採点ロジックは追加していない)。
  - 「サブシティ一覧」は都市データに該当フィールドが無いため非表示。
  - 参考HTML独自のヘッダー(ハンバーガー+ロゴ)は実装していない
    (このセクションは既存サイトの共通ヘッダーの中に埋め込まれるため、
    二重ヘッダーになってしまう)。
  - GSAP等の外部ライブラリには依存していない(参考実装と同じく
    素のCSSアニメーション+バニラJSのみで完結させている。CDN障害時の
    リスクが無い)。
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  全Destinationをテーマタグ付きでJSON化。themesは選択リスト
  (単一行テキストのリスト)型なので、d.themes.valueをそのまま配列
  として使う。
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign all_destinations = shop.metaobjects.destination.values -%}
<script type="application/json" id="quiz-destinations-{{ section.id }}">
[
  {%- for d in all_destinations -%}
    {%- assign theme_list = d.themes.value -%}
    {
      "name": {{ d.name_ja.value | json }},
      "nameEn": {{ d.name_en.value | json }},
      "url": "/pages/{{ d.slug.value }}",
      "image": {{ d.hero_image.value | image_url: width: 1600 | json }},
      "description": {{ d.description.value | strip_html | truncate: 120 | json }},
      "themes": [{% for t in theme_list %}{{ t | strip | downcase | json }}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{% endfor %}]
    }{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
]
</script>

<style>
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} {
    --dq-charcoal: #100e0b;
    --dq-warm-white: #faf7f2;
    --dq-gold: {{ section.settings.gold_color | default: '#cba876' }};
    --dq-gold-dk: #a8824f;
    --dq-gold-lt: #f1e6d2;
    --dq-ink: #1c1a16;
    --dq-ink-2: #5c574c;
    --dq-ink-3: #8f887a;
    --dq-line: rgba(255,255,255,.24);
    --dq-line-soft: rgba(28,26,22,.12);
    --dq-off-white: #faf8f4;
    --dq-ease: cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
    --dq-ease-soft: cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, sans-serif);
    background: var(--dq-charcoal);
    color: var(--dq-warm-white);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} *,
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} *::before,
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} button { font: inherit; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} a { color: inherit; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-serif { font-family: var(--font-heading-family, serif); }

  /* ---------- 粒子・グレイン(装飾。控えめ・reduced-motionで無効) ---------- */
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-grain {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 40; pointer-events: none; opacity: .035; mix-blend-mode: overlay;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='140' height='140'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='2' stitchTiles='stitch'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-particles { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 2; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-particle {
    position: absolute; border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,.55), transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(1px); opacity: .55; animation: dqDrift 16s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes dqDrift { 0%,100% { transform: translate(0,0); } 50% { transform: translate(14px,-34px); } }

  /* ---------- 画面(スクリーン)切り替え ---------- */
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-screen { display: none; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-screen.active { display: block; }
  @keyframes dqCineIn { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1.05); filter: blur(18px); } 55% { filter: blur(3px); } 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); filter: blur(0); } }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-anim-up,
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-anim-right,
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-anim-left { animation: dqCineIn 1.1s var(--dq-ease) both; will-change: opacity, transform, filter; }

  @keyframes dqRevealUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  @keyframes dqWordUp { from { transform: translateY(112%); } to { transform: translateY(0); } }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-mask-wrap { display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: top; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-reveal-word { display: inline-block; animation: dqWordUp .95s var(--dq-ease) both; }

  /* ---------- シーン(写真フルブリード) ---------- */
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-scene {
    position: relative; min-height: 100svh; width: 100%; overflow: hidden;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: clamp(90px, 12vh, 140px) 28px 64px;
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-scene-bg {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(130% 100% at 30% 15%, #332a1f 0%, #1a1712 45%, #0c0a08 85%);
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-scene-bg img {
    position: absolute; inset: -6%; width: 112%; height: 112%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0;
    filter: blur(18px) saturate(1.05); transition: opacity 1.6s var(--dq-ease), filter 1.6s var(--dq-ease);
    will-change: opacity, transform, filter;
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-scene-bg img.is-active { opacity: 1; filter: blur(0) saturate(1.05); animation: dqKenburns 20s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
  @keyframes dqKenburns { from { transform: scale(1) translate(0,0); } to { transform: scale(1.13) translate(-2%,-1.4%); } }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-scene-veil {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(9,8,6,.5) 0%, rgba(9,8,6,.18) 32%, rgba(9,8,6,.35) 60%, rgba(9,8,6,.72) 100%);
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-scene-content { position: relative; z-index: 3; width: 100%; max-width: 640px; text-align: center; color: var(--dq-warm-white); }

  /* ---------- イントロ ---------- */
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-hero-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block; font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; font-size: .74rem;
    letter-spacing: .42em; color: var(--dq-gold); margin-bottom: 26px; text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0; animation: dqRevealUp .9s var(--dq-ease) .2s both;
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-hero-title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .03em; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-hero-title em { font-style: normal; color: var(--dq-gold); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-hero-sub {
    font-size: .95rem; color: rgba(250,247,242,.82); line-height: 2; letter-spacing: .05em; max-width: 420px; margin: 0 auto 40px;
    opacity: 0; animation: dqRevealUp .9s var(--dq-ease) .85s both;
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-hero-pills { display: flex; gap: 28px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 44px; opacity: 0; animation: dqRevealUp .9s var(--dq-ease) 1s both; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-hero-pill { font-style: italic; font-size: .76rem; letter-spacing: .18em; color: var(--dq-gold); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(203,168,118,.55); padding-bottom: 3px; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-hero-cta-wrap { opacity: 0; animation: dqRevealUp .9s var(--dq-ease) 1.15s both; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-hero-hint { font-style: italic; font-size: .7rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); letter-spacing: .24em; margin-top: 18px; text-align: center; }

  /* ---------- スクロール誘導 ---------- */
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-next-indicator {
    position: absolute; bottom: 28px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 3;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
    opacity: 0; animation: dqRevealUp .9s var(--dq-ease) 1.3s both;
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-next-indicator-num { font-style: italic; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .18em; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-next-indicator-line {
    position: relative; width: 1px; height: 40px; overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.06), rgba(255,255,255,.7) 60%, rgba(255,255,255,0));
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-next-indicator-line::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -40px; left: 0; width: 1px; height: 40px; background: var(--dq-gold); animation: dqCueDrop 2.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes dqCueDrop { 0% { top: -40px; } 100% { top: 40px; } }

  /* ---------- 円形フロストボタン ---------- */
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-btn-circle {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
    width: 164px; height: 164px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.2); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.62);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(140%); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(140%);
    color: var(--dq-warm-white); font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform .45s var(--dq-ease), box-shadow .45s var(--dq-ease), background .35s var(--dq-ease);
    box-shadow: 0 22px 50px -18px rgba(0,0,0,.6), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-btn-circle::after { content: '→'; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: .95rem; transition: transform .3s var(--dq-ease); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-btn-circle:hover { transform: scale(1.06); background: rgba(255,255,255,.22); box-shadow: 0 28px 60px -14px rgba(203,168,118,.5); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-btn-circle:hover::after { transform: translateX(4px); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-btn-circle:active { transform: scale(.97); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-btn-circle:disabled { background: rgba(255,255,255,.05); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.18); color: rgba(255,255,255,.32); cursor: not-allowed; box-shadow: none; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-btn-circle:disabled::after { display: none; }

  /* ---------- 質問画面 ---------- */
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-q-wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-progress { margin-bottom: 30px; max-width: 200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-progress-track { height: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.22); position: relative; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-progress-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--dq-gold); transition: width .8s var(--dq-ease); position: relative; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-progress-dot { position: absolute; right: -4px; top: -3.5px; width: 8px; height: 8px; background: var(--dq-charcoal); border: 1.5px solid var(--dq-gold); border-radius: 50%; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-q-label { display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; opacity: 0; animation: dqRevealUp .7s var(--dq-ease) .1s both; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-kicker-num { font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; font-size: .92rem; letter-spacing: .05em; color: var(--dq-gold); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-kicker-sep { font-style: italic; color: rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-size: .78rem; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-q-label-text { font-style: italic; font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .32em; color: var(--dq-gold); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-q-title { font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3.6vw, 1.85rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: .02em; margin-bottom: 34px; text-align: center; }

  /* ---------- 選択肢(下線リスト) ---------- */
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opts { display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22); text-align: left; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opt {
    display: flex; align-items: center; width: 100%; background: transparent; border: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22); padding: 0; cursor: pointer; text-align: left;
    color: var(--dq-warm-white); transition: background .3s var(--dq-ease); position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opt:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.05); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opt.is-selected { background: rgba(203,168,118,.07); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opt-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; width: 100%; padding: 21px 4px; gap: 16px; transition: transform .35s var(--dq-ease); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opt:hover .dq-opt-inner,
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opt.is-selected .dq-opt-inner { transform: translateX(10px); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opt-main { font-size: .98rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .03em; display: block; transition: color .3s; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opt.is-selected .dq-opt-main { color: var(--dq-gold); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opt-radio { width: 19px; height: 19px; border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4); border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; position: relative; transition: border-color .2s; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opt.is-selected .dq-opt-radio { border-color: var(--dq-gold); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opt.is-selected .dq-opt-radio::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 5px; background: var(--dq-gold); border-radius: 50%; animation: dqRadioIn .18s var(--dq-ease); }
  @keyframes dqRadioIn { from { transform: scale(0); } to { transform: scale(1); } }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-ripple { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(203,168,118,.28); transform: scale(0); animation: dqRippleAnim .6s linear; pointer-events: none; }
  @keyframes dqRippleAnim { to { transform: scale(4); opacity: 0; } }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-opt:focus-visible { outline: 1px solid var(--dq-gold); outline-offset: -2px; }

  /* ---------- NAV(戻る) ---------- */
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-nav-wrap { margin-top: 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 18px; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-btn-back {
    background: none; border: none; font-style: italic; font-size: .8rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.62); letter-spacing: .1em;
    cursor: pointer; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3); padding-bottom: 3px; transition: color .2s, border-color .2s;
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-btn-back:hover { color: var(--dq-gold); border-color: var(--dq-gold); }

  /* ---------- ローディング(スロットマシン風) ---------- */
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-loading-outer { width: 100%; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-loading-kicker { font-style: italic; font-size: .74rem; letter-spacing: .36em; color: var(--dq-gold); display: block; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-loading-title { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: .06em; margin-bottom: 44px; color: var(--dq-warm-white); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-loading-ring { width: 44px; height: 44px; border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); border-top-color: var(--dq-gold); border-radius: 50%; animation: dqSpin 1.1s linear infinite; margin: 0 auto 36px; }
  @keyframes dqSpin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-loading-slot { height: 58px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-loading-slot-inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-loading-slot-item { height: 56px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.7rem; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: .16em; color: var(--dq-gold); flex-shrink: 0; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-loading-final {
    font-size: 2.3rem; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: .16em; color: var(--dq-gold);
    opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px) scale(.92); transition: opacity .9s var(--dq-ease), transform .9s var(--dq-ease);
    min-height: 56px; display: none; text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(203,168,118,.4);
  }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-loading-final.is-visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }

  /* ---------- 結果:ヒーロー ---------- */
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-result-hero { position: relative; min-height: 84svh; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; padding: 130px 28px 64px; text-align: center; overflow: hidden; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-result-hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; color: var(--dq-warm-white); max-width: 680px; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-result-kicker { font-style: italic; font-size: .74rem; letter-spacing: .3em; color: var(--dq-gold); display: block; margin-bottom: 16px; opacity: 0; animation: dqRevealUp .8s var(--dq-ease) .1s both; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-result-name { font-size: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .05em; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-result-name-en { font-style: italic; font-size: .92rem; letter-spacing: .2em; color: var(--dq-gold); opacity: 0; animation: dqRevealUp .8s var(--dq-ease) .5s both; }

  /* ---------- 結果:本文(白背景) ---------- */
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-result-body { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px 80px; background: var(--dq-off-white); color: var(--dq-ink); position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-result-body::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -80px; left: 0; right: 0; height: 80px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--dq-off-white)); pointer-events: none; }

  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-summary-bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 9px; padding: 32px 0 22px; justify-content: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dq-line-soft); }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-summary-tag { font-size: .74rem; color: var(--dq-ink-2); border: 1px solid var(--dq-line-soft); background: var(--dq-warm-white); border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 15px; letter-spacing: .06em; }

  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-matching-section { padding: 26px 0 0; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-matching-label-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  #destination-quiz-{{ section.id }} .dq-matching-label-text { font-style: italic; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .26em; color: var(--dq-ink-3); }
